{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/label2.png?t=1744669828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a spread of islands on the Pacific Ocean, you got yourself one, and you aim to be a farmer! it is a long way from home, but the corporate life is just not for you, not after what happened, not after all the years you lost in that life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, you were only able to get an island in ruin, and you barely have enough money to buy some seeds and see where its going! are you up to the challenge? lets find out!<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/label3.png?t=1744669828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>27 different plants!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 different trees</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>35+ main quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm expansions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daylight cycle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40+ Crafting recipies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10+ Buildings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 different animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/label1.png?t=1744669828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/Plant.g